    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d285">

                <pb facs="0364" n="290" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg290"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/780a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Sweden</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-12-07T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 7, 1917—3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>436. Your 1113, December 4, 4 p.m. Please ascertain informally and discreetly
                    Sweden’s feeling towards recognition of Bolshevik government. Department at
                    present awaiting developments but desires to be kept advised attitude of
                    neutrals on this subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
